  "prefLabel": "Ins 1103.03 Penalties",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1103.03 Penalties. Any insurer, producer, or any other person violating any of the provisions of this chapter shall be subject to the penalties provided in RSA 400-A:15, III.\n\nSource. #6953, eff 3-1-99 (formerly Ins 1101.07); ss by #8826, eff 3-1-07, EXPIRED: 3-1-15\n\nNew. #10866, eff 7-1-15; ss by #14512, eff 2-7-26, EXPIRES: 2-7-36",
